    "name": "Cartoon Clips Shorts",
    "description": "Picks a cartoon, finds an official clip of it on one of the show's official YouTube channels, cuts its funniest ~50 s moment into a vertical Short with captions, then publishes to @EpicVideoClips101.",
    "status": "active",
    "settings": {},
    "workflow": {
